                <pb facs="0543" n="431" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg431"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5121.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Chargé Vignaud</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic">March 12,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Convey to President of the Republic the heartfelt sympathy of the President and
                    sorrow of the American people for the terrible calamity suffered by the French
                    nation in the disaster of the <hi rendition="#italic">Jena</hi> and the death of
                    so many brave Frenchmen.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
